$MDESC::TimeOfDay = "Day";
$MDESC::Type = "Find and Retrieve";
$MDESC::Weather = "Clear";
$MDESC::TeamCount = "2";
$MDESC::Desc = "CrissCross: F&R";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Find and Retrieve" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Ultima Thule" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> In the wake of the fight for control of the abandoned towers, the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> now fight to reclaim the flags which serve as symbols of their conquest.  Four flags remain in each of the corner towers and must be taken back to base.  " @
         "Tower control systems were damaged in the fighting, leaving stations unrestricted and turrets randomly aligned.  The sole remaining control unit in the central tower should be able to restore partial control of the corner towers.  " @
         "The flags and the central tower are worth one point each, and whoever holds the most will be the victor!";
